    "title": "Upcoming Half Moon Bay community events",
    "text": "1 days ago The City of Half Moon Bay shared several events. There will be Movies in the Park showing Back to the Future this Saturday, 9/26 . A free used tire drop-off event will also take place on 9/26 . The last stop of the Implementation Plan Roadshow is coming on 9/28 .\nA Fall Recycling Event is planned for 10/3 , and an HWY 1 Community Design Workshop will be held on 10/7 . Neighbors can subscribe to city news at halfmoonbay.gov/newsletters to get more details and updates.\nThis content is adapted from materials provided by City of Half Moon Bay\nThis article includes content summarized and organized with AI tools, which can make mistakes. Learn more.",
